\"fontColor\":\"#008282\",\"textDecoration\":\"underline\"},\"wrapper\":{\"backgroundColor\":\"#ffffff\"},\"body\":{\"backgroundColor\":\"#008282\"}}}', 'https://ps.w.org/mailpoet/assets/newsletter-templates/retro_computing_magazine/thumbnail.20190411-1500.jpg', NULL, 1, NULL, '2026-11-05 09:25:41'),
