raft</strong> merupakan platform e-commerce yang menghadirkan berbagai produk kerajinan dan karya seni khas Indonesia, seperti batik, ukiran, dan anyaman bambu. Kami hadir sebagai wadah untuk memperkenalkan, melestarikan, serta memasarkan kekayaan budaya dan kerajinan tradisional Nusantara kepada masyarakat luas melalui platform digital.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"margin\":{\"right\":\"var:preset|spacing|60\",\"left\":\"var:preset|spacing|60\"}},\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var:preset|color|secondary\"}}}},\"textColor\":\"secondary\",\"fontSize\":\"mdm-large\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-secondary-color has-text-color has-link-color has-mdm-large-font-size\" style=\"margin-right:var(--wp--preset--spacing--60);margin-left:var(--wp--preset--spacing--60)\">Melalui Nusantara Craft, pelanggan dapat menemukan berbagai produk kerajinan berkualitas yang memiliki nilai seni, keunikan, dan ciri khas budaya dari berbagai daerah di Indonesia. Kami berkomitmen untuk mendukung para pengrajin lokal agar karya mereka semakin dikenal dan mampu bersaing di era digital.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"margin\":{\"right\":\"var:preset|spacing|60\",\"left\":\"var:preset|spacing|60\"}},\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var:preset|color|secondary\"}}}},\"textColor\":\"secondary\",\"fontSize\":\"mdm-large\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-secondary-color has-text-color has-link-color has-mdm-large-font-size\" style=\"margin-right:var(--wp--preset--spacing--60);margin-left:var(--wp--preset--spacing--60)\">Dengan kemudahan berbelanja secara online, kami berharap Nusantara Craft dapat menjadi tempat terpercaya bagi masyarakat untuk mendapatkan produk kerajinan tradisional sekaligus ikut berkontribusi dalam menjaga warisan budaya Indonesia agar tetap lestari dan dikenal hingga generasi mendatang.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"margin\":{\"right\":\"var:preset|spacing|60\",\"left\":\"var:preset|spacing|60\"}},\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var:preset|color|secondary\"}}}},\"textColor\":\"secondary\",\"fontSize\":\"mdm-large\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-secondary-color has-text-color has-link-color has-mdm-large-font-size\" style=\"margin-right:var(--wp--preset--spacing--60);margin-left:var(--wp--preset--spacing--60)\"><strong>Nusantara Craft – Melestarikan Budaya, Menghadirkan Karya Nusantara.</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"50px\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:50px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:columns {\"metadata\":{\"categories\":[\"call-to-action\"],\"patternName\":\"three-column-pricing-table\",\"name\":\"Three column pricing table\"},\"align\":\"wide\",\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"margin\":{\"bottom\":\"0\"},\"padding\":{\"right\":\"var:preset|spacing|60\",\"left\":\"var:preset|spacing|60\"},\"blockGap\":{\"left\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\"}}}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns alignwide\" style=\"margin-bottom:0;padding-right:var(--wp--preset--spacing--60);padding-left:var(--wp--preset--spacing--60)\"><!-- wp:column {\"style\":{\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var:preset|color|secondary\"}}},\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"2em\",\"right\":\"2em\",\"bottom\":\"2em\",\"left\":\"2em\"}},\"color\":{\"background\":\"#ffb67a\"}},\"textColor\":\"secondary\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column has-secondary-color has-text-color has-background has-link-color\" style=\"background-color:#ffb67a;padding-top:2em;padding-right:2em;padding-bottom:2em;padding-left:2em\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":109,\"sizeSlug\":\"full\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><img src=\"http://localhost/nusantara_craft/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Indonesian_Crafts_Icon_Collection__4_-removebg-preview.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-109\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"fontSize\":\"medium\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-medium-font-size\"><strong>Mendukung Pengrajin Lokal</strong>.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:separator {\"opacity\":\"css\",\"className\":\"is-style-wide\",\"style\":{\"color\":{\"background\":\"#000000\"}}} -->\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-text-color has-css-opacity has-background is-style-wide\" style=\"background-color:#000000;color:#000000\"/>\n<!-- /wp:separator -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"typography\":{\"textAlign\":\"center\"}}} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center\">Membantu memperkenalkan hasil karya pengrajin Indonesia agar semakin dikenal oleh masyarakat luas.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column {\"style\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#000000\",\"background\":\"#ffb67a\"},\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#000000\"}}},\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"2em\",\"right\":\"2em\",\"bottom\":\"2em\",\"left\":\"2em\"}}}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column has-text-color has-background has-link-color\" style=\"color:#000000;background-color:#ffb67a;padding-top:2em;padding-right:2em;padding-bottom:2em;padding-left:2em\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":110,\"sizeSlug\":\"full\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><img src=\"http://localhost/nusantara_craft/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Indonesian_Crafts_Icon_Collection__3_-removebg-preview.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-110\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"typography\":{\"lineHeight\":\"1.5\",\"textAlign\":\"center\"}},\"fontSize\":\"medium\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center has-medium-font-size\" style=\"line-height:1.5\"><strong>Belanja Mudah dan Praktis.</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:separator {\"opacity\":\"css\",\"className\":\"is-style-wide\"} -->\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-css-opacity is-style-wide\"/>\n<!-- /wp:separator -->\n\n<!-- wp:buttons {\"align\":\"full\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"flex\",\"justifyContent\":\"center\",\"orientation\":\"horizontal\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons alignfull\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:buttons -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"typography\":{\"textAlign\":\"center\"}}} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center\">Pelanggan dapat melihat katalog, memilih produk, dan melakukan pemesanan secara online kapan saja dan di mana saja.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column {\"style\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#000000\",\"background\":\"#ffb67a\"},\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#000000\"}}},\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"2em\",\"right\":\"2em\",\"bottom\":\"2em\",\"left\":\"2em\"}}}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column has-text-color has-background has-link-color\" style=\"color:#000000;background-color:#ffb67a;padding-top:2em;padding-right:2em;padding-bottom:2em;padding-left:2em\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":111,\"sizeSlug\":\"full\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><img src=\"http://localhost/nusantara_craft/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Indonesian_Crafts_Icon_Collection__2_-removebg-preview.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-111\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"typography\":{\"textAlign\":\"center\"}},\"fontSize\":\"medium\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center has-medium-font-size\"><strong>Produk Khas Nusantara.</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:separator {\"opacity\":\"css\",\"className\":\"is-style-wide\"} -->\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-css-opacity is-style-wide\"/>\n<!-- /wp:separator -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"typography\":{\"textAlign\":\"center\"}}} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center\">Menyediakan berbagai produk kerajinan tradisional Indonesia, mulai dari batik, ukiran kayu, hingga anyaman bambu yang memiliki keunikan tersendiri.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"50px\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:50px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:template-part {\"slug\":\"footer\",\"theme\":\"clothes-boutique\",\"tagName\":\"footer\"} /-->', 'Laman Depan', 'Menampilkan beranda situs Anda yang ditetapkan untuk menampilkan pos terbaru atau halaman statis. Templat Halaman Depan akan lebih diprioritaskan daripada semua templat lainnya.', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '28-revision-v1', '', '', '2026-11-05 09:43:11', '2026-11-05 09:43:11', '', 28, 'http://localhost/nusantara_craft/?p=115', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
